   "source": "base_case"
  },
  {
   "id": "post_zero_rates",
   "kind": "post",
   "text": "當所有稅率均為零時，無論應稅所得多少，稅務負債應為零。",
   "check": "close(f(taxable_income=taxable_income, tax_brackets=tax_brackets, tax_rates=[0.0] * len(tax_rates)), 0)",
