   "id": "post_income_below_first_bracket",
   "kind": "post",
   "text": "當應稅所得低於第一個稅級門檻時，稅務負債應為所得乘以第一個稅率。",
   "check": "close(f(taxable_income=tax_brackets[0] / 2, tax_brackets=tax_brackets, tax_rates=tax_rates), (tax_brackets[0] / 2) * tax_rates[0])",
