   "text": "通道線的長度應為 `min(len(prices) - period_ema + 1, len(prices) - period_atr)`",
   "check": "len(result['middle_line']) == min(len(prices) - period_ema + 1, len(prices) - period_atr)",
   "source": "dbc"
  },
  {
   "id": "post_band_order",
   "kind": "post",
   "text": "上軌線的數值應始終大於等於中線，中線的數值應始終大於等於下軌線",
   "check": "all(u >= m for u, m in zip(result['upper_band'], result['middle_line'])) and all(m >= l for m, l in zip(result['middle_line'], result['lower_band']))",
   "source": "dbc"
  },
  {
   "id": "post_zero_multiplier",
   "kind": "post",
   "text": "當ATR乘數為0時，上軌線和下軌線應與中線重合",
