{
 "title": "頻率分佈計算",
 "topic": "統計分析",
 "output": {
  "name": "frequency_distribution",
  "label": "頻率分佈",
  "unit": "個"
 },
 "slots": [
  {
   "name": "data",
   "label": "數據列表",
   "kind": "list",
   "unit": "數值"
  },
  {
   "name": "interval_width",
   "label": "區間寬度",
   "kind": "number",
   "unit": "小數"
  }
 ],
 "conventions": [],
 "fixed": [
  {
   "name": "interval_definition",
   "text": "區間定義為左閉右開：`[start, end)`。"
  },
  {
   "name": "first_interval_start",
   "text": "第一個區間的起點為數據集中的最小值。"
  },
  {
   "name": "interval_coverage",
   "text": "區間會覆蓋從最小值到最大值的所有數據點。"
  }
 ],
 "invariants": [
  {
   "id": "pre_data_not_empty",
   "kind": "pre",
   "text": "數據列表不能為空。",
   "check": "len(data) > 0",
   "source": "dbc"
  },
  {
   "id": "pre_interval_width_positive",
   "kind": "pre",
   "text": "區間寬度必須是正數。",
   "check": "interval_width > 0",
   "source": "dbc"
  },
  {
   "id": "post_sum_frequencies",
   "kind": "post",
   "text": "所有區間的頻率總和應等於數據點的總數。",
   "check": "sum(result.values()) == len(data)",
   "source": "dbc"
  },
  {
   "id": "post_keys_are_tuples",
   "kind": "post",
   "text": "結果字典的鍵必須是表示區間範圍的二元元組 (start, end)。",
   "check": "all(isinstance(k, tuple) and len(k) == 2 for k in result.keys())",
   "source": "dbc"
  },
  {
   "id": "post_values_are_non_negative_integers",
   "kind": "post",
   "text": "結果字典的值必須是非負整數（頻率）。",
   "check": "all(isinstance(v, int) and v >= 0 for v in result.values())",
   "source": "dbc"
  },
  {
   "id": "post_interval_width_consistent",
   "kind": "post",
   "text": "每個區間的寬度應與 `interval_width` 參數一致。",
   "check": "all(close(k[1] - k[0], interval_width) for k in result.keys())",
   "source": "dbc"
  },
  {
   "id": "post_first_interval_start_at_min_data",
   "kind": "post",
   "text": "第一個區間的起點應等於數據集中的最小值。",
   "check": "close(min(k[0] for k in result.keys()), min(data))",
   "source": "dbc"
  },
  {
   "id": "post_last_interval_covers_max_data",
   "kind": "post",
   "text": "最後一個區間的終點應大於或等於數據集中的最大值。",
   "check": "max(k[1] for k in result.keys()) >= max(data)",
   "source": "dbc"
  },
  {
   "id": "post_single_data_point",
   "kind": "post",
   "text": "如果數據集只有一個點，則結果應包含一個頻率為 1 的區間，且該區間包含該數據點。",
   "check": "len(data) == 1 and len(result) == 1 and list(result.values())[0] == 1 and list(result.keys())[0][0] <= data[0] < list(result.keys())[0][1]",
   "source": "induction"
  },
  {
   "id": "meta_shift_data",
   "kind": "meta",
   "text": "如果數據集中的所有點都平移一個常數，則區間也會相應平移，頻率保持不變。",
   "check": "shift_val = 1.0; shifted_data = [d + shift_val for d in data]; shifted_result = f(shifted_data, interval_width); len(shifted_result) == len(result) and all(shifted_result.get((k[0] + shift_val, k[1] + shift_val)) == v for k, v in result.items())",
   "source": "metamorphic"
  },
  {
   "id": "meta_scale_data",
   "kind": "meta",
   "text": "如果數據集中的所有點和區間寬度都按比例縮放，則區間也會相應縮放，頻率保持不變。",
   "check": "scale_val = 2.0; scaled_data = [d * scale_val for d in data]; scaled_interval_width = interval_width * scale_val; scaled_result = f(scaled_data, scaled_interval_width); len(scaled_result) == len(result) and all(scaled_result.get((k[0] * scale_val, k[1] * scale_val)) == v for k, v in result.items())",
   "source": "metamorphic"
  }
 ],
 "completeness_note": "請注意，提供的參考實作在數據集 `data` 中所有值都相同（即 `min(data) == max(data)`）時，會返回空字典 `{}`，這與本卡片所定義的正確行為（應包含該數據點的頻率）不符。本卡片中的不變量旨在判斷一個『正確』的頻率分佈計算程式，因此參考實作在這種情況下將會違反部分不變量（例如 `post_sum_frequencies` 和 `post_single_data_point`）。"
}

